BT /F1 9.4 Tf 54 168.6 Td (10. Keep overextension checks so the bot does not chase Gold after the move is mostly gone.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.4 Tf 54 156.6 Td (11. Keep wick rules for confirmation and stop-loss placement.) Tj ET
